used in almost all modern workstations, MPPs, and supercomputers 
running UNIX. Those data formats are IEEE (used by almost all UNIX
workstations), DEC (VAX machines running UNIX), CRAY (for non-MPP Crays),
and IBM (370 running UNIX). 

