        gopher://info.pilgrim.umass.edu/77/lib/.wais-sources/osf-dce-rfc.txt
          (indexed search of DCE RFCs)

  Transarc has some hints and examples available on-line;
  get grand.central.org:/pub/devkit

==================================================================
